	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a deo patre per Christum servatorem nostrum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quam<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>vis literas tuas, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> candidissime doctissimeque serius accepimus, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quam tu putaris, accepimus nihilominus una cum munere li<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>terario eoque inprimis grato eo, quod iamdudum expectavimus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ingenti desiderio, ut communicaretur ecclesiae Christi, sperantes <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ingenti cum fructu illud publicatum iri.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Vis a me stare, ut illum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>aut mihi aut bibliothecae nostrae reservem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">In hoc sane sentio, quantum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>me ames, atque utinam se vel semel offerat iusta et commoda <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>occasio animi mei benevolentiam erga te declarandi; intelligeres certe <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>me non esse in postremis eorum, qui te unice observant.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sed dominus retribuat <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tibi, quod ego praestare non possum, in illo die.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Apocalipsis collocabitur inte<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>r primarios ac classicos autores (in) nost<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ra bibli(othec)a, et quia communis erit nobis omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>liber, communi omnium symmistarum meorum nomine iussus sum tibi quam accuratis<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sime gratias agere offerentium et suam ipsorum erga te observantiam.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Adamum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>illum christianum mihi reservabo eoque nomine seorsim tibi gratias ago.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Nova, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quae apud nos iactantur, incerta sunt hancque ob rem non facile spargenda.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nobilis <lb xml:id="p1z18"/><placeName ref="l2779">Hegaugię</placeName> non extremus retulit cuidam civi nostro <persName>Ferdinandum Budam</persName> vi <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>recepisse Pestoque imminere <foreign xml:lang="de">mit 4000 schwartzer küryser,</foreign> per quos etiam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>profligavit aliquot milia <placeName ref="l2510">Turcarum</placeName> deletis 7000 captisque Guasco uno <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>cum multis nobilibus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><persName>Bolwilerum</persName> eversis duobus in <placeName ref="l691">Lotharingia</placeName> oppidulis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Divionem obsessurum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Cum sanna rogavit item illud nostrum, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quando tandem redituri sint nostri a <placeName ref="l994">Neapoli</placeName>; inde collegit forte omnes.<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>.. dione excisos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Vide miseriam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l441">Scaffhusia</placeName> adhuc vexillum missura <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>est post quatuor illa priora in <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName>, ut <persName>Gallus</persName> intelligat nos ipsius <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nomine periclitaturos non tantum pro milite, sed et pro patria ipsa.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Vide insaniam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Admonitiones nostras seu privatas seu publicas non admittunt, imo, nisi in<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>telligerent rem omnium nostrum in acie novaculae hęrere, iam conati fuissent <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nobis exemplo <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensium</placeName> ora obturare.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Intelligis, quantum <persName>Gallici</persName> auri <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>fames apud nos possit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Igitur commendo et nos et ecclesias nobis commissas o<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>rationibus tuis, ut nostri dominus misereatur restituatque in viam rectam.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>De <placeName ref="l572">Wirtembergensi</placeName> etc. tam absurda audio, ut ea scribere pigeat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Ich schick üch hiemit min handtschrifft an <persName>Jergen Bachofen</persName> von wegen <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p6382">Hans Adamen Schad</persName>; wellind ime dieselbig zuͦstellen, damitt <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>und er zefriden sye.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Vale, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> humanissime, meque, ut soles, ama.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Scripsissem citius; per negotia <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>tamen non potui.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l441">Scaffhusii</placeName> anno 1557. 14. octobris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/><persName>Ludovico</persName> dedi hodie et literas et aes, quod ipsi dedisti.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Agit tibi gratias <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>et accingitur ad reditum <placeName ref="l491">Argentoratum</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="signature">[Unterschrift fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[Darunter von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/><persName>Ludwig Kolmar</persName> hatt minem <persName ref="p477">H<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>(ans) Rodolffen</persName> zuͦ <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>2 fl. gelihen; die schickt <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>und bezallt ich imm.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctrina et pietate insigni viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae pastori <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>vigilantissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ac fratri in Christo <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>observando.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
